<<if $phase is 2 or $phase is 3>>
<<if $phase is 2>>They seem a little annoyed that you aren't actually leaving but soon continue chatting and playing around without paying much attention to you.
<<else>>You observe the kids without coming too close, they seem a little curious about you but not enough to actually approach you.<</if>>
Time passes and looking at them having fun relaxes you even if you aren't having fun with them.

At some point they stop to talk about something before one of them yells at you "Hey you! Come here."

<<if $phase is 4>>
"Spill it, what do you want from us? You keep hanging around like some creep."
<<link [[Ask to play with them]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[say nothing]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[I don't know]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Sorry, it's nothing]]>><</link>>
<br>

"We aren't really interested in making new friends and certainly not with girls/boys." the others nod along, "But you know what? Jean here has/We've always wanted a pet so if you could become one for us we wouldn't mind playing with you."
<<link [[Nod]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

"He/She must be shy", "That's alright, I feel sorry for him/her" "We usually wouldn't let a boy/girl/loser like you hang out with us but if you keep your mouth shut and do as you're told we could make an exception for you, so come along now" they start walking back to where they were
<<link [[follow them]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[leave]]>><</link>>
<br>


/* they could more forcefully decide that you'll be their pet */
