"Look, she's still here?" "I wonder what her deal is, maybe she has no friends or why else would she waste time just staring at us." one of them starts talking directly to you "You! We feel sorry for you so we're going to let you become our pet. Here, come to me!" he says as he pats his thigh.
<<link [[go to him]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[do nothing]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[leave]]>><</link>>
<br>
